# Context allowlist for the worker image only. BuildKit prefers
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the root .dockerignore, so the web image's
# context stays exactly as narrow as it already was.
#
# The worker needs the lockfile (it shares the single pinned dependency set) and
# its own source. It must never receive the Next application, the public assets
# or any environment file.
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!services/worker/**
services/worker/Dockerfile
services/worker/Dockerfile.dockerignore
